<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bangalore to Bhubaneswar | Call 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does bike transport from Bangalore to Bhubaneswar typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The standard transit time for bike transport from Bangalore to Bhubaneswar is 4 to 6 days, covering approximately 1,420 km via the NH 16 corridor. Shree Ashirwad optimizes routing, leverages dedicated hydraulic‑ramp trailers, and monitors traffic conditions to ensure timely delivery without compromising safety.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures does Shree Ashirwad use to protect my bike during the journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad employs a zero‑scratch guarantee that combines 7‑layer foam wrapping, custom wooden crates for delicate parts, hydraulic ramp loading, and enclosed container trucks. Each bike is secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and monitored through live GPS, ensuring protection against shocks, weather, and theft.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any documents required for bike transport from Bangalore to Bhubaneswar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Customers must provide a valid bike registration certificate, a government‑issued identity proof, and a signed consignment note. For corporate or government reimbursements, Shree Ashirwad also supplies GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills, all of which meet IBA mover code regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for bike transport from Bangalore to Bhubaneswar determined?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on four main factors: total distance, the type of specialized container or trailer required, the level of insurance coverage selected, and any additional handling services such as door‑to‑door pickup or custom packaging. Transparent quotes are provided upfront, with no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Shree Ashirwad equips every shipment with satellite‑GPS devices that feed live location data to a secure portal. Customers receive real‑time updates via SMS or email, allowing them to monitor progress from Bangalore to Bhubaneswar and receive estimated arrival notifications.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for my bike during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers 100% declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI, covering loss, theft, and transit damage. The policy is automatically applied to every shipment, and customers receive a detailed insurance certificate outlining coverage limits and claim procedures.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is door‑to‑door pickup and delivery available for bike transport between these cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. The service includes doorstep pickup in Bangalore, careful loading onto hydraulic‑ramp trailers, secure transit, and final doorstep delivery in Bhubaneswar. Shree Ashirwad coordinates timing with the customer, handles all paperwork, and ensures the bike is ready for use upon arrival.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
